OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned Jaguar appeal over man's
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the shooting of a
OL,7,Fman have appealed for information about
OL,8,Fa soft top sports car which was found
OL,9,Fdumped.
OL,11,FA 46-year-old man remains in a critical
OL,12,Fbut stable condition after shots were
OL,13,Ffired at a house on Balmer Hill, in
OL,14,FGainford near Darlington, at about
OL,15,F20:10 on Saturday.
OL,17,FDurham Police are trying to piece
OL,18,Ftogether the movements of a red F-type
OL,19,FJaguar cabriolet with a black roof
OL,20,Fwhich was seen in the south of the
OL,21,Fcounty between 12:00 and 21:00 BST on
OL,22,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
