OL,5,
OL,6,FThe car, which has the registration
OL,7,FMM13 KCC, was found abandoned in Witton
OL,8,FPark having earlier been seen in Crook,
OL,9,FWillington, Bishop Auckland, Newton
OL,10,FAycliffe and Gainford.
